Subject: Sacrifice outlets that only scry or surveil: do not pay with the board when about to die
Why: ComputerUtil.getCardPreference ("SacCost") has a last resort for the declare blockers step:
  when lifeInSeriousDanger, pay a sacrifice cost with anything, whatever the ability does. For
  Umbral Collar Zealot (Jund Sacrifice; "Sacrifice another creature or artifact: Surveil 1") that
  meant sacrificing creatures that were not in combat, one after another, for surveil 1 each,
  which cannot change the combat. In a 30-games-per-pairing gauntlet of Jund Sacrifice against
  the meta decks (seed 1, --save-logs) it did so in 33 of 510 games (75 creatures: Gene
  Pollinator, Biotech Specialist, Greedy Freebooter, The Sackville-Bagginses, Smaug ...) and won
  2 of them. Now, for an ability whose every step is Scry, Surveil, Mill or
  RearrangeTopOfLibrary, that branch pays only with a creature this combat destroys anyway, or
  not at all.
Measured: PENDING

diff --git a/forge-ai/src/main/java/forge/ai/ComputerUtil.java b/forge-ai/src/main/java/forge/ai/ComputerUtil.java
index b7c7666e..74d70718 100644
